<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Marxon Solar Privacy Policy</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for the Marxon Solar app published by Guangdong Marxon Electronics Co., LTD.">
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      --background: #f2f7f4;
      --surface: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
      --text: #15221b;
      --muted: #58675f;
      --brand: #116c47;
      --brand-dark: #093d2b;
      --line: #dbe6df;
      --shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(12, 55, 34, 0.09);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--text);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(17, 108, 71, 0.14), transparent 28rem),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #f7faf8 0%, var(--background) 100%);
      font: 16px/1.72 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI",
        "PingFang SC", "Noto Sans SC", Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    a { color: var(--brand); }

    .page {
      width: min(980px, calc(100% - 28px));
      margin: 30px auto 64px;
    }

    .hero,
    .card {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 22px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 34px;
      color: #f5fff9;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand), var(--brand-dark));
    }

    .hero h1 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 6vw, 3.8rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0;
      color: rgba(245, 255, 249, 0.88);
    }

    .meta {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .pill {
      padding: 7px 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    .nav {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin: 18px 0;
      padding: 15px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: var(--surface);
    }

    .nav a {
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: var(--text);
      text-decoration: none;
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .nav a:hover {
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--brand);
      border-color: var(--brand);
    }

    .card {
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 28px;
      background: var(--surface);
    }

    .card h2 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      color: var(--brand);
      line-height: 1.25;
    }

    .card p { margin: 10px 0; }

    .card li + li { margin-top: 8px; }

    .chinese { border-left: 5px solid #299665; }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 22px;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .page { margin-top: 14px; }
      .hero, .card { padding: 21px; border-radius: 18px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="page">
    <header class="hero">
      <h1>Marxon Solar Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy applies to the <strong>Marxon Solar</strong> mobile
        application, package name <strong>com.marxon.marxonSolar</strong>,
        published by <strong>Guangdong Marxon Electronics Co., LTD</strong>.
      </p>
      <div class="meta">
        <span class="pill">Effective: November 20, 2026</span>
        <span class="pill">English &amp; 中文</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <nav class="nav" aria-label="Privacy policy sections">
      <a href="#purpose">Purpose</a>
      <a href="#collection">Data Collection</a>
      <a href="#use">Data Use</a>
      <a href="#sharing">Sharing</a>
      <a href="#rights">Your Rights</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      <a href="#zh">中文</a>
    </nav>

    <section class="card" id="purpose">
      <h2>1. App purpose</h2>
      <p>
        Marxon Solar allows authorized users to create or access an account,
        monitor compatible solar and energy-storage equipment, view stations,
        collectors, devices, energy statistics and alarms, bind equipment by
        scanning a code, configure supported devices, and manage subordinate
        users where the account has permission.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card" id="collection">
      <h2>2. Information we collect and process</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Account and contact data:</strong> account name, email address
          or mobile phone number, country calling code, verification code, and
          authentication credentials required for registration, login, password
          reset, and account support.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Precise location and station information:</strong> latitude,
          longitude, country, province, city, area, and an optional address when
          you choose to locate or create a station. Location permission is
          requested only when you use a location-related feature.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Camera and scan data:</strong> camera access and QR or barcode
          content you choose to scan, used to identify, look up, and bind a
          compatible collector or device.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Equipment and energy data:</strong> device identifiers and
          serial numbers, station and device names, installed capacity,
          operating status, power and energy measurements, alarms,
          configuration values, and commands you request.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>User-management data:</strong> names, accounts, email
          addresses, mobile numbers, locations, and user roles entered or viewed
          by authorized manufacturer or administrator accounts.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Technical and security data:</strong> app version, device and
          operating-system information, IP-derived region information, access
          and refresh tokens, request metadata, and limited server logs needed
          for security, diagnostics, and service operation.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Authentication tokens are stored in protected device storage. Marxon
        Solar does not include third-party advertising or advertising SDKs and
        does not sell personal data.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card" id="use">
      <h2>3. How we use information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Provide registration, login, account recovery, and authorized user management.</li>
        <li>Connect accounts with stations, collectors, and devices and display requested operational data.</li>
        <li>Locate stations, bind equipment, process alarms, and perform user-requested settings or control operations.</li>
        <li>Maintain service reliability, prevent misuse, troubleshoot faults, secure accounts, and comply with applicable law.</li>
        <li>Respond to support, privacy, safety, and legal requests.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="card" id="sharing">
      <h2>4. Sharing and international processing</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell personal data. Information may be processed by our
        backend infrastructure and service providers only as needed to operate,
        secure, and support Marxon Solar. We may disclose information when
        required by law or when reasonably necessary to protect users, rights,
        property, or service security.
      </p>
      <p>
        Depending on where you use the app, information may be processed in a
        country or region other than your own, subject to applicable safeguards.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>5. Retention and security</h2>
      <p>
        We retain information only for as long as reasonably necessary to
        provide the service, meet legal obligations, resolve disputes, and
        protect the service. We use reasonable administrative and technical
        safeguards, including encrypted network transport and protected local
        token storage. No electronic system can be guaranteed completely secure.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card" id="rights">
      <h2>6. Your choices and rights</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          You may deny or revoke camera and location permissions in system
          settings. Core monitoring may remain available, but scanning or
          automatic location features may not work.
        </li>
        <li>You may correct profile or station information where the app provides that function.</li>
        <li>You may sign out and clear locally stored session data.</li>
        <li>
          To request access, correction, deletion, restriction, or other rights
          available under applicable law, contact us using the details below.
          We may need to verify account ownership before acting.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>7. Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Marxon Solar is intended for equipment owners, installers,
        distributors, and other authorized users, not for children. We do not
        knowingly collect children's personal data in violation of applicable
        law.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card" id="contact">
      <h2>8. Contact and policy changes</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Guangdong Marxon Electronics Co., LTD</strong><br>
        Website: <a href="https://www.marxon.com/">https://www.marxon.com/</a><br>
        Email: <a href="mailto:export@marxon.net">export@marxon.net</a><br>
        Phone: <a href="tel:+867583982115">+86-758-3982 115</a>
      </p>
      <p>
        We may update this policy to reflect changes to the app, law, or our
        practices. The current version will remain available at this URL with an
        updated effective date.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card chinese" id="zh" lang="zh-CN">
      <h2>Marxon Solar 隐私政策（中文）</h2>
      <p>
        本政策适用于广东马克森电子有限公司发布的 Marxon Solar 应用
        （包名：<strong>com.marxon.marxonSolar</strong>），生效日期为
        2026 年 11 月 20 日。
      </p>
      <p>
        为提供账号注册与登录、光伏及储能设备监控、设备扫码绑定、电站定位、
        能量与告警展示、设备设置及授权用户管理等功能，应用可能处理以下信息：
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>账号、邮箱或手机号、验证码及认证信息；</li>
        <li>你主动使用定位功能时的精确经纬度、地区及可选地址；</li>
        <li>你主动扫码时的相机权限和二维码或条码内容；</li>
        <li>电站、采集器和设备标识、序列号、运行状态、功率、能量、告警及配置数据；</li>
        <li>授权管理账号录入或查看的姓名、账号、邮箱、手机号、地区和用户角色；</li>
        <li>为安全、诊断和服务运行所需的应用版本、设备系统信息、IP 推断地区、登录令牌、请求信息及有限日志。</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        应用不包含第三方广告或广告 SDK，不出售个人信息。相关信息仅在提供、保护
        和支持 Marxon Solar 服务所需范围内由我们的后台基础设施和服务提供方处理，
        或在法律要求及保护用户和服务安全所必要时披露。
      </p>
      <p>
        你可以在系统设置中关闭相机或定位权限，也可以联系我们，申请访问、更正、
        删除、限制处理或行使适用法律赋予你的其他个人信息权利。处理请求前，我们
        可能需要验证账号所有权。
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>联系方式：</strong><br>
        官网：<a href="https://www.marxon.com/">https://www.marxon.com/</a><br>
        邮箱：<a href="mailto:export@marxon.net">export@marxon.net</a><br>
        电话：<a href="tel:+867583982115">+86-758-3982 115</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <p class="footer">
      © 2026 Guangdong Marxon Electronics Co., LTD. All rights reserved.
    </p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
        
